you got to
find Sully.

820
01:00:28,918 --> 01:00:30,834
- And I'm there.
- Ow. Ow.

821
01:00:30,835 --> 01:00:32,084
How many more
of these, huh?

822
01:00:32,085 --> 01:00:33,125
Not many more.

823
