921
01:04:54,543 --> 01:04:56,085
That really
sucks.

922
01:04:56,960 --> 01:04:59,625
That makes me
even more of a freak.

923
01:04:59,626 --> 01:05:01,959
No, granddaughter.

924
01:05:01,960 --> 01:05:04,918
You are Eywa's child.

925
01:05:11,210 --> 01:05:12,292
I don't care

926
