from her.

933
01:05:36,501 --> 01:05:37,917
It's some kind
of firewall.

934
01:05:37,918 --> 01:05:39,084
Yeah, it's like
an encryption.

935
01:05:39,085 --> 01:05:40,334
The harder
you try to break in,

936
01:05:40,335 --> 01:05:41,751
